check 1
# A Fallen (monstats 19, normal) poked 2 sub-tiles from the player in the
# Blood Moor (warp 2 at frame 4; town allows no combat) walks in and melee-hits the player; no input. Compare
# the Fallen's modes / seeds and the player's life (stat 6) frame by frame:
# monster melee on the player, hit recovery, damage (PC1-B round 2).
# Seeds fixed before the spawn as in poke-fallen-town.
name combat-fallen-hits-player
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 200
seconds 300
channels state
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 19 @x+2 @y normal
